## When to NOT use the framework

- Trivial typo fix in a doc → just edit
- Quick code-review comment → just write it
- Sandbox / experimental scratch file → just write it; the framework isn't a tax on exploration

The framework is for **production-shape work**. Day-to-day exploratory coding doesn't need orchestrator overhead.

