## Per-quarter maintenance

Run `prompts/REFINEMENT-PROMPT.md` from the framework repo. It walks through:
- Audit specialist usage (drop dead ones, refactor over-broad ones)
- Audit instruction-file `applyTo:` (tighten globs, fix non-matching ones)
- Audit `copilot-instructions.md` length (trim if past 200 lines)
- Audit `docs/ai-context/` for tier-1 → tier-3 archive moves
- Add new pitfalls from the last quarter's notes
